  "identifier": "h-optimus-0",
  "name": "H-optimus-0",
  "description": "1.1-billion parameter vision transformer foundation model for histopathology — the largest publicly available pathology FM by parameter count. Trained on 500,000+ H&E stained whole-slide images from a proprietary multi-institutional collection. Outputs 1536-dimensional feature vectors. Evaluated on mutation prediction, survival analysis, and tissue classification. Apache 2.0, 27k+ monthly HuggingFace downloads. Note: model file access requires a contact agreement with Bioptimus despite the Apache 2.0 licence. Developed by Bioptimus (Paris).",
