  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The largest publicly available pathology FM by parameter count (1.1B) — strong benchmark performance on mutation prediction and survival analysis. Apache 2.0 licence, but model file access currently requires a contact agreement with Bioptimus, which creates a practical friction not reflected in the formal licence. Assess until the access process is standardised. Technically compelling; worth tracking as Bioptimus opens access further.",
